note collab/co7md.om (ForgePatches): patch and issue text is rendered as Markdown by ForgeBrowse's
note renderer (browse/b_md.om brmd: every text byte escaped, raw HTML dropped, unsafe link schemes
note refused; fixtures browse/tests/md). Relative links resolve against the repo root at gbref: a patch
note page uses the shown revision's head commit, an issue page the default branch.
text tcmd1 "<article class=\"md\">\n"
text tcmd2 "</article>\n"
note comd o n: render gcpool[o,o+n) (copied into fxo, which brmd reads) into fob
fn comd o ulong n ulong to void
if eq n 0
ret
end
for k ulong n bound 4194304
put fxo k get gcpool add o k
end
put gbmdl 0 0
fput tcmd1
brmd 0 n
fput tcmd2
end
note codref r: gbref = head commit of revision r (the default branch when r is not a revision)
fn codref r ulong to void
if gt r 63
codrefb
ret
end
o = mul r 40
for k ulong 40
put gbref k get gcro add o k
end
put gbrefl 0 40
end
fn codrefb to void
i = get fridx 0
o = get fabo i
n = get fabl i
for k ulong n bound 64
put gbref k get fabr add o k
end
put gbrefl 0 n
end
